Kite Memory Audit

Original application, evidence collector, HTTP integration, and evidence-replay
logic in this project are provided under Apache-2.0.

Third-party materials:

1. gokite-ai/kite-x402-services, Apache-2.0
   https://github.com/gokite-ai/kite-x402-services
   Source commit: 893a27509648b660bbba626b0da59619a94f04ab
   src/kite.ts adapts network/token constants from templates/typescript-express/src/kite.ts.
   Payment integration follows the official verify -> upstream -> settle model.
   schema/service.schema.json is copied unchanged from that repository.
   Changes: fixed-precision integer pricing, explicit route and resource URL,
   bounded/redacted facilitator operations, in-process audit handler and tests.

2. AwareLiquid/AgentMemoryState
   https://github.com/AwareLiquid/AgentMemoryState
   Source commit: 81b14054a75852f4300f612fb88c94457e57299f
   Public v1/v2 test vectors are reused for interoperability tests, with provenance
   recorded in test/fixtures. They are not original contribution code or real memory.
   The example Space and registry addresses refer to the project's public Sepolia
   test deployment. No private witnesses, keys, or salts are accepted by this API.

3. ERC-8350 specification, CC0-1.0
   https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8350
   Normative type strings, event signatures, and formulas are implemented for
   interoperability. ERC-8350 remains Draft; pin and review specification changes.

Dependencies retain their respective licenses. See package-lock.json.
